7.1 Mission Workflow Activity Diagram — ACT-001
Objective
Show the operational thread from an authorized analyst's task request through governed discovery, automated analysis, human review, and dissemination. The architecture distinguishes automated processing from human analytical judgment and release authority.
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A([Analyst initiates mission request]) --> B[Authenticate and authorize request]
  B --> C{Authorized?}
  C -->|No| D[Reject and audit] --> END1([End])
  C -->|Yes| E[Discover authorized catalog assets]
  E --> F{Suitable data available?}
  F -->|No| G[Notify analyst / await approved input] --> END2([Pending / end])
  F -->|Yes| H[Create workflow execution]
  H --> I[Dispatch analytical processing]
  I --> J{Processing successful?}
  J -->|No| K[Recovery / escalation workflow] --> END3([Failed or resumed])
  J -->|Yes| L[Register result and provenance]
  L --> M[Compose draft report]
  M --> N[Analyst reviews findings]
  N --> O{Approved for release?}
  O -->|No| P[Revise / reject / retain draft] --> N
  O -->|Yes| Q[Validate recipients and release policy]
  Q --> R{Release authorized?}
  R -->|No| S[Block release and audit] --> END4([End])
  R -->|Yes| T[Disseminate approved product]
  T --> U[Archive approval and delivery evidence] --> END5([Complete])
```
ACT-001 activity specification
Step	Responsible actor/service	Input	Output / state	Requirement mapping
1. Request mission task	Mission analyst / SYS-030	Task parameters	Submitted request	R-010.1, R-010.4
2. Authorize request	SYS-021 / SYS-040	User identity, policy, context	Permit or deny	R-060.1, R-060.2
3. Discover data	SYS-011	Search criteria and permissions	Authorized asset references	R-040.3, R-060.2
4. Execute workflow	SYS-023	Workflow template and asset IDs	Execution state	R-020.4, R-010.3
5. Perform analysis	SYS-024	Authorized data references	Result object and status	R-010.3, R-050.3
6. Register lineage	SYS-025 / SYS-011	Processing evidence	Provenance and result metadata	R-050.1–R-050.4
7. Review report	SYS-080 / analyst	Draft report	Approved/rejected state	R-080.1–R-080.3
8. Disseminate	SYS-080	Approved product and recipient policy	Delivery receipt	R-080.4


Control point: Workflow completion does not imply approval to disseminate. Human review and release authorization remain explicit steps.
